[{"_id":"66c72317c33122b03a51b223","id":"jniimi/weather_forecast_japan","author":"jniimi","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-10-26T09:41:47.000Z","likes":4,"private":false,"sha":"25475c5ccb33050a2b81cddd061574d0099c269a","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains daily-collected weather forecasts for up to seven days ahead for all the meteorological observatories in Japan, published by the Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA) at https://www.jma.go.jp/bosai/forecast/. \nWe collect, structurize, and accumulate the prediction since the page is overridden whenever the information is updated. \nThe data is automatically updated daily using GitHub Actions. Since the actual forecasts are published multiple times a day… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/jniimi/weather_forecast_japan.","downloads":3816,"tags":["task_categories:tabular-regression","task_categories:tabular-classification","language:ja","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:100K<n<1M","format:parquet","format:optimized-parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","climate"],"createdAt":"2024-08-22T11:37:59.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa4ce473eaa602a1688745f","id":"openthomas/weather-forecasts","author":"openthomas","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-10-29T02:53:35.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"92cceb708020e61efebc9fcaef05152ca5116d00","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOpenThomas weather forecasts\n\t\n\nEvery forecast the OpenThomas weather desk read or\nproduced, as-of. Pushed daily from the trading box, so each commit is a\ntimestamped record of what was known when — the leak-free substrate behind\nthe paper's replay experiments (docs/EXPERIMENTS.md in the\nharness repository).\n\n\t\n\t\t\nfile\nwhat\nlines / bytes\n\n\n\t\t\ndata/nwp-guidance-and-settlements.jsonl\nas-of daily extremes from seven public NWP models (Open-Meteo previous-runs API) at leads 0-5, plus… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/openthomas/weather-forecasts.","downloads":2088,"tags":["license:mit","region:us","weather","numerical-weather-prediction","prediction-markets","forecasting","graphcast","gencast","build-in-public"],"createdAt":"2026-09-12T04:00:07.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"68e49815be19e86a124bf16b","id":"nuuuwan/lk-dmc-weather-forecasts-chunks","author":"nuuuwan","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-10-29T12:53:46.000Z","likes":2,"private":false,"sha":"35f1bdb442388d75e704f9e405dcb236561ecc92","downloads":1673,"tags":["size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:parquet","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us"],"createdAt":"2025-10-07T04:33:25.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"68e4980ef7de31c0ed253570","id":"nuuuwan/lk-dmc-weather-forecasts-docs","author":"nuuuwan","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-10-29T12:53:42.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"0cdcc837380b5f1a4a6b68b6a54cc5c53916e6d1","downloads":1364,"tags":["size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us"],"createdAt":"2025-10-07T04:33:18.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a97f6e4acf3881f66f2e41c","id":"THULab/wids2023_competition_weather_forecasting","author":"THULab","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-07T11:13:26.000Z","likes":0,"private":false,"sha":"2ee0047ff2b8914b5221b4b6d7b6a90ad2ddf4ce","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWiDS 2023 Weather Forecasting (TsFile format)\n\t\n\nApache TsFile conversion of mirai-ml/wids2023_competition_weather_forecasting. The repository contains both source splits from the same Hugging Face dataset.\nModalities: Time-series.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThe WiDS Datathon 2023 task forecasts the arithmetic mean of the maximum and minimum temperature over the following 14 days for each US location and start date. The source combines weather, climate, forecast-model, and oscillation… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/THULab/wids2023_competition_weather_forecasting.","downloads":234,"tags":["task_categories:tabular-regression","task_categories:time-series-forecasting","language:en","license:cc-by-nc-4.0","size_categories:100K<n<1M","modality:timeseries","region:us","tsfile","timeseries","modality:timeseries","format:tsfile","weather","climate","forecasting","wids-2023"],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T10:13:56.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"666caa98de375f31140c23b8","id":"sayanroy058/Weather-Time-Series-Forecasting","author":"sayanroy058","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2024-06-14T20:42:34.000Z","likes":13,"private":false,"sha":"4e2bf89924ed406a37dc61ba3a860f46f91a2d4a","downloads":179,"tags":["region:us"],"createdAt":"2024-06-14T20:39:52.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6adad367f9df2d89697d8fd2","id":"OliverLee520/WeatherForecast","author":"OliverLee520","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-10-29T08:01:07.000Z","likes":4,"private":false,"sha":"f999fd0f3e866d806c258b347e1efb99511eccdb","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWeatherForecast\n\t\n\nEnglish · 简体中文\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tResolution variants\n\t\n\nThis public repository contains the existing low-resolution derivatives and their pre-downsampling source files. Source upload is complete (48 files; Hub paths and sizes verified); the low-resolution files remain available. Check Source/manifest.json for the intended inventory and source documentation for completion status.\n\n\t\n\t\t\nComponent\nPre-downsampling source\nExisting low-resolution derivative… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OliverLee520/WeatherForecast.","downloads":179,"tags":["license:other","modality:geospatial","modality:timeseries","arxiv:2002.00469","arxiv:2507.17189","region:us","w